{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31386","headline":"颍亭 · 韩琮","name":"颍亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"颍上新亭瞰一川，几重旧址敞幽关。\n寒声北下当轩水，翠影西来扑槛山。\n远目静随孤鹤去，高情常共白云闲。\n知君久负巢由志，早晚相忘寂寞间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩琮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}